    "text": "1. Confirm that this procedure applies only to reactor cell `RX-3A`; backup cell `RX-3B` is not affected.\n2. Verify that:\n   - License `NRC-8801` is current.\n   - Coolant flow for `RX-3A` shows **Normal**.\n   - Control rods indicate `full-insertion`.\n3. Execute:\n   ```sh\n   hyperctl status RX-3A\n   ```\n4. Continue only if the output shows:\n   ```text\n   temp=ambient pressure=nominal\n   ```\n5. **WARNING:** The next step initiates irreversible fuel loading into `RX-3A`. Emergency shutdown after loading requires regulatory approval.\n6. Execute:\n   ```sh\n   hyperctl load-fuel RX-3A --license NRC-8801\n   ```\n7. After loading completes, execute:\n   ```sh\n   hyperctl verify RX-3A\n   ```\n8. Confirm that the output is:\n   ```text\n   fuel=loaded rods=inserted\n   ```",
